# Exception: the take-off regression suites must travel with the branch. They
# are the only proof that a saved measurement keeps its definition, its geometry
# id, its basis sentence and its undo chain against a real database, and that a
# line cannot be restated from another organisation's session — so a checkout
# that lacks them can silently reintroduce the defects they were written to
# catch. Half of them WERE missing, and a `tsx --test` run skips a named file
# that is not there without failing, so the gap was invisible until a fresh
# clone was audited.
#
# Every entry below is exactly one file, and the list is closed against the
# canonical gate from both ends by `packages/backend/scripts/takeoff-suites.ts`:
#   * a suite named in the manifest but absent on disk  -> the gate exits 1
#   * a *.test.ts in one of these directories but absent from the manifest
#     -> the gate exits 1
# So a suite that is added here and nowhere else, or gated and never un-ignored,
# fails loudly instead of quietly. Keep it one path per line and keep it in step
# with that manifest — do NOT widen this to un-ignore tests generally, and do
# NOT un-ignore a historical worktree to pick a suite up.
#
# packages/backend/src/modules/panda-ai/pdf-takeoff — 43
