# Generated agent/package-manager scratch at the repo root. Ignored, never
# deleted: /.claude/worktrees holds other workers' live checkouts and
# /.pnpm-store is the content-addressed package cache. Scoped with a leading
# slash so a real .claude/skills or a package's own store is unaffected.
/.claude/worktrees/
/.pnpm-store/
